<title>NETHERLANDS: Generale raises Ten Cate 1997, 1998 EPS.</title>
<headline>Generale raises Ten Cate 1997, 1998 EPS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of March 10 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Ten Cate   textiles/plastics  95.00   Gen. Oyens Van Eeghen</p>
<p>COMMENT: Denim activities, which had extraordinary charge in 1996, should improve. Rubber division could also rebound. We maintain buy recommendation on 12 month price target of NLG110.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     pvs EPS   P/E    Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)     7.03    -----     13.5    3.00</p>
<p>    1997		  9.65     9.25	9.8</p>
<p>    1998		 10.85    10.40	8.8</p>
